  era: "6th c. BCE \xB7 Section 4 \xB7 Religious Movements \xB7 6th \u2013 5th century BCE onwards"
  title: Teachings of Mahavira
  text: 'Mahavira taught five vows: ahimsa, non-violence; satya, truth; asteya, not stealing; aparigraha, non-possession; and brahmacharya, chastity. Jainism also teaches anekantavada, the idea that truth has many sides.'
